Z||000000||yo_sweet||11-30-2001||12:14 AM||||today i drove my car to the front of the school where everyone hangs out , i usually speed by and stuff  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">! , this time i was at a red light i sat music blaring waiting for a green light then the lights turns green i step on the pedal no juice! turn it off turn it on again ,no juice! , 3rd time it kicked in , i think the aux guage flashed, anyone know the problem? i floord the pedal twice and nothing happend the car woulden't move, btw i have heard a belt squeeking for the last few days!<P>------------------<BR>1986 Fiero SE 2.8lv6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dance.gif">  <P><BR>www.geocities.com/acme_s2000/intro.html<BR>yo_sweet!||||reg||8
Z||000001||Kasdan||11-30-2001||02:35 AM||||Sounds like your alt wasnt charging, and ur car raun off batery power for a while, and then finally died.  happened to me at a stop light before, same exact thing.<P>------------------<BR>Tyler Morgan, 1986 GT<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kassig2.gif">                  <BR>Aftermarket Power Steering, Rebuilt 2.8<BR>http://www.geocities.com/mtyler14/index.html||||reg||1
Z||000002||yo_sweet||12-01-2001||01:05 AM||||did you find out what the cause was?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fierowrecker||12-01-2001||12:18 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by yo_sweet:<BR><B>did you find out what the cause was?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Pull your alternator and look at the large deep hole (as opposed to the short shallow hole!), and see if it is oblonged instead of round, if it is round, have it checked at your local auto shop...<BR>It may not be putting out the full charge...<BR>If it is oblonged, then replace it...<BR>Or if you are good at machining...<BR>Drill it round,insert an aluminum rod and drill it the proper size...<BR>When the hole goes out of round, the belt does not center properly in the pulley, and slips after wearing out quickly...<BR>crash...<p>[This message has been edited by Fierowrecker (edited 12-01-2001).]||||reg||1
